flowchart TD
    A[Run Evidence] --> B[Recurring Problem]
    B --> C[Root Cause Analysis]
    C --> D{Instruction Deficiency?}
    D -- No --> E[Improve Appropriate Component]
    D -- Yes --> F[Propose Instruction Change]
    F --> G[Owner Review]
    G --> H[Approved Update]
    H --> I[Evaluate Future Runs]
